1
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:03,360
Hey, Yui!

2
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:04,934
See if this will work!

3
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,320
I'm transferring the code!

4
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:10,295
We're gonna teleport!

5
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:11,951
Daddy, give me your hand!

6
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:20,460
Daddy! Daddy!

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,700
Yui, where are we?

8
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:26,330
I don't know.

9
00:00:26,413 --> 00:00:27,917
There's no mapping data available.

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,300
Then do you know where Asuna is? Yes.

11
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:33,660
She's close.

12
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:35,160
Very close, in fact.

13
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:37,540
This way!

14
00:01:07,140 --> 00:01:08,280
Is this it?

15
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:10,700
Is this the top of the world tree?

16
00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:15,925
There's supposed to be
a floating city up here.

17
00:01:16,940 --> 00:01:18,940
There was never any grand quest.

18
00:01:19,220 --> 00:01:21,044
The whole damn thing was a lie.

19
00:01:21,140 --> 00:01:22,580
He's gonna pay for this.

20
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,677
Yeah, I know.

21
00:01:25,760 --> 00:01:29,140
So, we got to get Asuna out
of here first, right? Mm-hmm.

22
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:00,950
I'm standing on my heart.

23
00:02:01,033 --> 00:02:03,057
I'm standing on my hand.

24
00:02:03,140 --> 00:02:04,657
I'm standing on my heart.

25
00:02:04,740 --> 00:02:07,177
I'm standing on my heart.

26
00:02:07,260 --> 00:02:10,417
And now I'm standing on my heart?

27
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:11,971
I'm standing on my heart.

28
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:14,977
If I don't have any trouble!

29
00:02:15,060 --> 00:02:17,277
I'll never shoot you.

30
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:22,860
I'm not there yet, but I'm not there yet.

31
00:02:24,060 --> 00:02:28,920
If I'm here, I'll never see the future.

32
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:34,440
I'm not there yet, but I'm not there yet.

33
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:38,257
I'm not there yet, but I'm not there yet.

34
00:02:41,940 --> 00:02:43,220
I'm still crying.

35
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:47,677
Channeling by the right word!

36
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:53,017
I'm making you a little bit.

37
00:02:53,100 --> 00:02:54,517
You'll be thinking about?

38
00:02:54,600 --> 00:02:55,430
I'm in front

39
00:02:55,513 --> 00:03:02,397
of the sky.

40
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:05,377
It will go through the sky!

41
00:03:05,460 --> 00:03:10,137
This moment in the future,

42
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:20,180
I'll show you next time.

43
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:39,800
Mommy! Mommy!

44
00:03:50,460 --> 00:03:51,290
Mommy!

45
00:03:52,260 --> 00:03:53,660
Yui!

46
00:03:54,260 --> 00:03:55,660
Mommy!

47
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:57,440
Yui!

48
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:01,520
Mommy!

49
00:04:16,380 --> 00:04:17,210
Kirito

50
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:20,310
Asuna

51
00:04:25,540 --> 00:04:27,857
Hey, sorry I took so long?

52
00:04:27,940 --> 00:04:29,657
No, it's okay.

53
00:04:29,740 --> 00:04:30,657
Really?

54
00:04:30,740 --> 00:04:33,160
I always knew you'd save me.

55
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:40,960
Well, ready to go home?

56
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:47,100
Hey, Yui, can you log Asuna out from here?

57
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:48,670
Uh-uh.

58
00:04:48,820 --> 00:04:52,517
Her status is locked by complicated
codes that I don't have access to.

59
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:55,437
We'll need to find a system
console to bypass them.

60
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:57,477
I found a console in the laboratory.

61
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,390
I can...

62
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:02,470
What's that?

63
00:05:08,220 --> 00:05:10,500
Yui, what's happening?

64
00:05:14,100 --> 00:05:16,880
Daddy, Mommy, be careful.

65
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:19,740
Something, something bad's coming.

66
00:05:21,340 --> 00:05:22,240
Yui!

67
00:05:28,220 --> 00:05:29,050
Asuna.

68
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:39,600
What a surprise.

69
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:45,020
The last thing I expected to find was
a cockroach in my little bird's cage.

70
00:05:45,300 --> 00:05:47,800
You've got to be kidding! It's Sugou!

71
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:50,320
Mama.

72
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:53,697
I'd prefer it if you didn't
call me that name in this world.

73
00:05:53,780 --> 00:05:57,620
You should address me as His
Highness, the Fairy King Oberon!

74
00:05:59,220 --> 00:06:00,050
Kiriko!

75
00:06:00,660 --> 00:06:02,020
How do you like it?

76
00:06:02,320 --> 00:06:04,037
Want to know why you can't move?

77
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:08,037
It's a little something called gravity
magic coming out in the next update.

78
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:10,117
You think the players will go for it?

79
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:12,320
Leave him alone, you coward!

80
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:14,760
Tell me something, Kirigaya.

81
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:17,780
Or should I call you Kirito instead?

82
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:21,480
How did you manage to
get all the way up here?

83
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:25,220
I saw a strange program
running, is that how?

84
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:28,700
I flew up here with my wings!

85
00:06:29,580 --> 00:06:30,410
Ha!

86
00:06:30,493 --> 00:06:31,323
Suit yourself.

87
00:06:31,580 --> 00:06:33,637
If you don't want to tell me, that's fine.

88
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:36,680
I'll just go ask your mind instead. What?

89
00:06:37,260 --> 00:06:38,240
Oh, please.

90
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:40,677
You don't really think I went to all that

91
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:43,297
trouble setting this whole
thing up just for fun,

92
00:06:43,380 --> 00:06:44,210
did you?

93
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:48,417
I have 300 former players
of SAO under my thumb,

94
00:06:48,500 --> 00:06:51,265
and now, thanks to their
dedicated cooperation,

95
00:06:51,420 --> 00:06:54,077
the technology I developed
for total control

96
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:56,720
of emotions and thought is 80 % complete.

97
00:06:57,560 --> 00:07:00,031
I'm about to achieve what no one else has,

98
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:03,640
the total control of the human
soul, the power of a god.

99
00:07:03,900 --> 00:07:06,080
It's so close, I can almost taste it.

100
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:09,266
Seriously, thank god for
virtual reality, huh?

101
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:14,510
Sugou!

102
00:07:14,860 --> 00:07:17,277
You're never going to get
away with this, you hear?

103
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:18,220
You monster!

104
00:07:19,220 --> 00:07:21,337
Who do you think's going to stop me?

105
00:07:21,420 --> 00:07:22,720
Oh, maybe a god.

106
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:24,757
But sadly, there's none in this world.

107
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:29,240
Except for yours truly, I know!

108
00:07:29,540 --> 00:07:32,157
Before I start tinkering
with your little souls,

109
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:34,652
why don't we have ourselves a little fun?

110
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:45,260
You bastard!

111
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:46,700
Leave her alone!

112
00:08:05,500 --> 00:08:06,330
Yes!

113
00:08:09,460 --> 00:08:10,290
Great!

114
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:13,337
That's what I was hoping for.

115
00:08:13,420 --> 00:08:16,244
You can't get NPC girls
to make faces like that.

116
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:22,180
You smell lovely.

117
00:08:22,980 --> 00:08:27,509
Figuring out how to replicate the way
you smell in real life was a challenge.

118
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:31,517
And don't even get me
started on how hard it was to

119
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:34,680
get an analyzer into your
hospital room undetected.

120
00:08:35,660 --> 00:08:37,040
Get away from her!

121
00:08:42,620 --> 00:08:44,460
Give me a break.

122
00:08:44,740 --> 00:08:48,580
Why don't you stay down and
grovel like a good little doggy?

123
00:08:52,180 --> 00:08:53,010
No!

124
00:08:58,820 --> 00:09:03,560
System command, change the pain
absorber from level 10 to level 8.

125
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:09,340
Hurts, doesn't it?

126
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:13,717
I'll increase the pain gradually to
give you something to look forward to.

127
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:14,760
By the way,

128
00:09:15,020 --> 00:09:19,667
once it drops below level 3, it'll start
affecting your body in the real world.

129
00:09:20,100 --> 00:09:21,220
As for you...

130
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:27,080
Stop it!

131
00:09:27,860 --> 00:09:28,690
Shuko!

132
00:09:29,300 --> 00:09:30,940
It's okay, Kirito.

133
00:09:31,420 --> 00:09:34,080
Whatever he does, he's
not really hurting me.

134
00:09:35,820 --> 00:09:37,640
I was hoping you'd say that.

135
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:42,440
But I wonder how long your pride's
going to last. 30 minutes? An hour?

136
00:09:42,800 --> 00:09:46,200
Why don't we see how long
you can hang on to it?

137
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:07,894
Now that that's out of the way, would
you like to know what I'm thinking?

138
00:10:07,980 --> 00:10:12,700
Once we've had our fun here, I'm going
to pay you a visit at the hospital.

139
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:17,037
I'll set up a big monitor and
play back a recording of this.

140
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:20,280
And we can enjoy ourselves all over again.

141
00:10:21,280 --> 00:10:24,640
But this time, with your real body.

142
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,240
Yummy.

143
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:40,480
How sweet.

144
00:10:41,460 --> 00:10:42,290
Go!

145
00:10:42,380 --> 00:10:43,540
You bastard!

146
00:10:44,060 --> 00:10:45,440
You bastard!

147
00:10:53,580 --> 00:10:56,300
I'll kill you! You hear?

148
00:10:56,640 --> 00:10:58,580
I'm going to kill you! No!

149
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:14,040
Why is this happening?

150
00:11:15,180 --> 00:11:18,920
Am I being punished for thinking
I was some kind of hero?

151
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:23,040
For thinking I was the only
one who could save Asuna?

152
00:11:24,060 --> 00:11:27,940
For thinking I was strong
enough even though I'm not?

153
00:11:33,980 --> 00:11:35,440
Are you giving up?

154
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,640
Are you giving up?

155
00:11:41,060 --> 00:11:41,890
No.

156
00:11:41,973 --> 00:11:43,500
I'm facing reality.

157
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:45,520
Then you are giving up.

158
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:48,240
To the power of a system you once defied.

159
00:11:49,020 --> 00:11:50,900
What choice do I have?

160
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,580
I'm just a player.

161
00:11:52,900 --> 00:11:54,440
And he's the GM.

162
00:11:55,100 --> 00:11:58,300
Then our battle was... what? A joke?

163
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:01,577
Do you remember how
you showed me the power

164
00:12:01,660 --> 00:12:04,307
of the human will was
superior to the system?

165
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:07,541
How you showed me the
possibilities of the future?

166
00:12:08,140 --> 00:12:08,970
You're...

167
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:13,460
Get up, Kirito. Get up!

168
00:12:26,900 --> 00:12:31,837
your attacks are weak the blades in SAO

169
00:12:31,920 --> 00:12:36,820
hit way harder and they hurt way more

170
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:46,230
Unbelievable.

171
00:12:46,313 --> 00:12:48,600
I've got a few bugs left to deal with.

172
00:12:51,580 --> 00:12:52,977
System login.

173
00:12:53,060 --> 00:12:54,720
ID Heathcliff.

174
00:12:56,380 --> 00:12:57,210
What?

175
00:12:57,293 --> 00:12:58,680
Whose ID are you using?

176
00:12:59,700 --> 00:13:00,760
System command.

177
00:13:01,080 --> 00:13:02,837
Enable administrator privileges.

178
00:13:02,920 --> 00:13:04,900
Set ID Oberon to level one.

179
00:13:07,020 --> 00:13:09,160
An ID that outranks mine?

180
00:13:09,540 --> 00:13:10,737
That's impossible!

181
00:13:10,820 --> 00:13:13,300
This is my world. I'm the creator.

182
00:13:13,620 --> 00:13:16,020
I'm its ruler. It's king. It's God.

183
00:13:16,200 --> 00:13:17,435
No, I don't think so.

184
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:20,160
You stole everything in this world.

185
00:13:20,420 --> 00:13:22,480
Everything, including its people.

186
00:13:22,900 --> 00:13:27,253
You're nothing but a king of thieves,
sitting alone on your stolen throne.

187
00:13:27,900 --> 00:13:29,197
You little punk.

188
00:13:29,280 --> 00:13:30,340
You dare?

189
00:13:30,560 --> 00:13:32,600
You dare talk to me like that?

190
00:13:33,640 --> 00:13:34,740
System command.

191
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:36,240
Generate object.

192
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:38,100
ID Excalibur.

193
00:13:39,900 --> 00:13:45,777
Do as I say you piece of crap system
your god is ordering you to comply.

194
00:13:45,860 --> 00:13:50,380
Think you can wait a little bit
longer this will only take a sec.

195
00:13:53,900 --> 00:13:59,280
System command generate
object id excalibur.

196
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:04,920
A simple command summons a
legendary weapon who knew.

197
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:16,220
It's time to settle the score.

198
00:14:16,660 --> 00:14:19,860
The King of Thieves
versus the Gilded Hero.

199
00:14:21,260 --> 00:14:24,420
System Command, set Pain Absorber to zero.

200
00:14:25,680 --> 00:14:27,260
No, not that.

201
00:14:27,560 --> 00:14:28,820
Did you just flinch?

202
00:14:29,100 --> 00:14:32,837
Because the other guy never flinched,
no matter how bad things got.

203
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:33,750
You know him.

204
00:14:34,140 --> 00:14:35,240
Akihiko Kayaba.

205
00:14:35,520 --> 00:14:37,140
Oh my God. God.

206
00:14:37,740 --> 00:14:38,570
Kayaba?

207
00:14:38,653 --> 00:14:39,700
Oh, I get it.

208
00:14:39,860 --> 00:14:40,960
That was his ID.

209
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:42,470
Why?

210
00:14:42,620 --> 00:14:44,197
You're supposed to be dead.

211
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:46,257
Why are you still getting in my way?

212
00:14:46,340 --> 00:14:48,300
You are always doing this.

213
00:14:48,500 --> 00:14:51,265
Acting all high and
mighty, like some big shot,

214
00:14:51,380 --> 00:14:53,897
taking everything that
was rightfully mine.

215
00:14:53,980 --> 00:14:56,800
Sugo, in a way, I get
where you're coming from.

216
00:14:57,100 --> 00:14:58,460
I lost to him, too.

217
00:14:58,800 --> 00:15:00,800
And then I had to go work for him.

218
00:15:02,500 --> 00:15:05,437
But whatever happened, I
never wanted to be him.

219
00:15:05,520 --> 00:15:07,140
Unlike you.

220
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:09,497
Damn you!

221
00:15:09,580 --> 00:15:10,640
Goddamn you!

222
00:15:27,300 --> 00:15:28,720
Hurts, doesn't it?

223
00:15:29,220 --> 00:15:32,260
But it's nothing like the
pain you made Asuna feel.

224
00:15:32,620 --> 00:15:33,580
Not even close!

225
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:06,350
Ah!

226
00:16:06,780 --> 00:16:08,500
Ah! Ah!

227
00:16:10,880 --> 00:16:11,920
Ah!

228
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:36,760
I had faith in you.

229
00:16:38,060 --> 00:16:39,360
I have faith in you.

230
00:16:40,120 --> 00:16:41,840
Always have, always will.

231
00:16:42,760 --> 00:16:44,701
And I know you'll always save me,

232
00:16:45,300 --> 00:16:46,653
because you're my hero.

233
00:16:48,060 --> 00:16:50,360
I don't have any power.

234
00:16:50,860 --> 00:16:52,440
I'm not a hero.

235
00:16:57,420 --> 00:17:00,640
But I'll do my best to be one.

236
00:17:04,120 --> 00:17:04,950
Come on.

237
00:17:05,033 --> 00:17:06,040
Let's go home.

238
00:17:08,980 --> 00:17:11,509
It's gotta be nighttime
already back there.

239
00:17:11,860 --> 00:17:14,801
But I'll see you at the
hospital as soon as I can.

240
00:17:15,120 --> 00:17:16,532
I'll be waiting for you.

241
00:17:16,780 --> 00:17:20,015
I want you to be the first
person I see when I wake up.

242
00:17:22,620 --> 00:17:24,460
It's finally over, isn't it?

243
00:17:24,700 --> 00:17:25,800
We're going home.

244
00:17:26,660 --> 00:17:28,120
Back to the real world.

245
00:17:29,340 --> 00:17:30,170
That's right.

246
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:33,807
But a lot's changed, so
try not to freak out.

247
00:17:34,980 --> 00:17:37,180
Let's go places and do fun things.

248
00:17:37,380 --> 00:17:39,440
Just the two of us. Sound good?

249
00:17:39,760 --> 00:17:41,180
Yeah, real good.

250
00:18:09,400 --> 00:18:10,420
That's it.

251
00:18:10,860 --> 00:18:11,920
Game over.

252
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:14,080
Or is it?

253
00:18:16,340 --> 00:18:18,320
What do you think, Heathcliff?

254
00:18:20,160 --> 00:18:22,680
Good to see you again, Kirito.

255
00:18:22,980 --> 00:18:24,420
So you are alive.

256
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:27,460
You could say I'm alive, in a way.

257
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:32,481
Ultimately, I'm the afterimage of
the mind that was Akihiko Kayaba.

258
00:18:32,820 --> 00:18:33,880
An echo.

259
00:18:34,500 --> 00:18:37,794
And, as usual, I have no idea
what you're talking about.

260
00:18:38,060 --> 00:18:40,119
I guess I should thank you, though.

261
00:18:40,920 --> 00:18:42,155
That's not necessary.

262
00:18:42,540 --> 00:18:43,540
What do you mean?

263
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:48,014
We're not exactly friends, so we
shouldn't expect favors from each other.

264
00:18:48,480 --> 00:18:49,617
There's always a price.

265
00:18:49,700 --> 00:18:50,530
Always.

266
00:18:50,840 --> 00:18:52,722
Okay, what do you want me to do?

267
00:19:02,380 --> 00:19:03,210
What's this?

268
00:19:03,293 --> 00:19:04,905
The beginnings of a new world.

269
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:06,500
I call it the seed.

270
00:19:08,360 --> 00:19:10,820
Once it sprouts, you'll know what it is.

271
00:19:11,240 --> 00:19:13,181
What you do with it is up to you.

272
00:19:13,420 --> 00:19:15,479
You can even delete it if you want.

273
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:16,950
However,

274
00:19:17,033 --> 00:19:20,537
if you still have a tiny bit of
fondness left for the virtual world,

275
00:19:20,620 --> 00:19:21,973
you'll take care of it.

276
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:26,300
I should get going now.

277
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:29,060
I do hope we meet again, Kirito.

278
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:37,830
Yui!

279
00:19:37,920 --> 00:19:40,940
Are you okay? Where are you? Daddy!

280
00:19:42,060 --> 00:19:42,900
Thank God.

281
00:19:43,260 --> 00:19:44,160
You're safe.

282
00:19:44,860 --> 00:19:45,690
Uh-huh.

283
00:19:45,773 --> 00:19:49,266
I hid myself inside the local
memory of your nerve carrier egg.

284
00:19:49,500 --> 00:19:52,180
Where's Mommy? Don't worry. She's safe.

285
00:19:52,660 --> 00:19:55,080
She's back home now. Mommy's back?

286
00:19:55,820 --> 00:19:56,980
Thank goodness!

287
00:19:57,460 --> 00:19:59,620
I'm so happy! Really!

288
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:02,600
I promise we'll be back to visit soon.

289
00:20:03,620 --> 00:20:06,997
Although, I don't know how much
longer this world's gonna be around.

290
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:10,897
It doesn't matter because my core
program's inside your nerve gear now.

291
00:20:10,980 --> 00:20:12,627
So we'll always be together.

292
00:20:13,800 --> 00:20:15,560
Alright, I better head out.

293
00:20:15,800 --> 00:20:17,153
I'm gonna go see Mommy.

294
00:20:18,700 --> 00:20:19,530
Okay, Daddy.

295
00:20:19,613 --> 00:20:20,443
I love you!

296
00:20:47,020 --> 00:20:47,880
I'm sorry!

297
00:20:48,280 --> 00:20:52,045
When you didn't log out right
away, I got worried, and then I...

298
00:20:52,940 --> 00:20:54,940
Sorry I took so long to come back.

299
00:20:55,540 --> 00:20:57,140
Is it really over now?

300
00:20:58,060 --> 00:20:59,180
Yeah, it is.

301
00:20:59,820 --> 00:21:00,900
It's all over.

302
00:21:02,460 --> 00:21:03,342
That's awesome!

303
00:21:07,620 --> 00:21:08,450
Hey, Sugu.

304
00:21:08,533 --> 00:21:10,677
Thank you for all the help you gave me.

305
00:21:10,760 --> 00:21:12,760
I couldn't have done it on my own.

306
00:21:12,900 --> 00:21:15,037
You're the reason I was able to finish it.

307
00:21:15,120 --> 00:21:15,950
No.

308
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:22,297
You don't have to thank me for a thing.

309
00:21:22,380 --> 00:21:26,380
I'm just happy I got the chance to
help my big brother in his world.

310
00:21:34,080 --> 00:21:35,660
What happened with Asuna?

311
00:21:36,100 --> 00:21:37,335
Did you get her back?

312
00:21:38,120 --> 00:21:39,100
Uh-huh. Finally.

313
00:21:39,880 --> 00:21:41,680
She's back in the real world.

314
00:21:42,880 --> 00:21:46,080
Sugu, I, uh... Uh-uh. You get going.

315
00:21:46,780 --> 00:21:49,662
She's got to be wondering
where you're at by now.

316
00:21:56,680 --> 00:21:58,240
Oh, it's cold.

317
00:21:58,920 --> 00:22:00,500
Look, snow.

318
00:22:03,960 --> 00:22:08,020
Be careful out there, and say
hi to Asuna for me. You got it.

319
00:22:08,200 --> 00:22:10,729
I can't wait for you
guys to meet for real.

320
00:23:04,380 --> 00:23:07,440
Highly, highly, with this hand!

321
00:23:07,840 --> 00:23:12,100
With the light of the light.

322
00:23:35,940 --> 00:23:38,740
Next time, the world's seed.
